# TypeUI in this project (UI file edits)

Cloud-first: see `.cursor/rules/typeui-cloud-only.mdc` (always on). When creating or changing user interfaces:

1. **Pitch UI** — `proposals/DESIGN.md` ([getdesign.md](https://getdesign.md/design-md) style) for `proposals/thelliyankal-pitch.html`.
2. **Design system** — `.cursor/skills/design-system/SKILL.md` (switch via `typeui/vendor/design-skills/<slug>/`).
3. **Fundamentals** — `.cursor/skills/typeui-fundamentals/`.
4. **Brand** — `.cursor/skills/thelliyankal-brand/SKILL.md`.

Do not ship broken layouts. Use 8px spacing rhythm and 44px minimum touch targets.
